## Hosting

Origin is **GitHub** `Buchtanen/ir-obs-switcher`. Issues, PRs, and CI go through `gh` + GitHub MCP. Do not assume a GitLab remote or GitLab CI.

## Parallel work

Use multiple agents and git worktrees only when tasks are **independent**:

- different files (do not split overlapping `logic/` + `iracing/` + API in one burst)
- **never split** overlay HUD: `display-v4.js`, `overlay.js`, `overlay/i18n.py`, `index.html`, overlay CSS — one agent, sequential
- each task: own branch (see `05-git-branching-convention.mdc`) + own GitHub issue
- one worktree per branch; never commit on `master`

Do **not** parallelize overlapping edits. Stopped subagents, stash ping-pong, and surprise CI lint after a burst mean the work should have been sequential.

After an agent finishes: return diff + evidence. Push/PR/merge only with user approval.

Command: `/parallel-plan` to split a backlog before launching agents.
